---
title: "Mechanica voice — the manual never enters the browser, and neither does the key"
---
flowchart LR

%% ---------------- legend ----------------
LG1["GREEN = Deepgram Voice Agent<br/>one socket: listen · think · speak"]:::dg
LG2["WHITE = our code"]:::ours
LG3["ORANGE = the manufacturer's book"]:::book
LG1 ~~~ LG2 ~~~ LG3

MIC["mic · AudioWorklet<br/>24 kHz linear16<br/>1,024-sample frames (~43 ms)"]:::ours
WK["Cloudflare Worker<br/>/ws/deepgram/agent<br/><b>holds DEEPGRAM_API_KEY</b><br/>no credential in the tab"]:::ours

subgraph DG["Deepgram Voice Agent — ONE socket"]
  L["<b>listen</b> · flux-general-en v2<br/>eager EOT 0.4 · EOT 0.7 · timeout 2 s<br/>keyterms = this bike's vocabulary"]:::dg
  T["<b>think</b> · open_ai gpt-4.1<br/>prompt, digest and tool wiring<br/>built by OUR server per manual"]:::dg
  S["<b>speak</b> · aura-2-asteria-en"]:::dg
end

SET["GET /api/voice/agent-settings<br/>?manualId=&amp;bikeId=<br/>the whole Settings message"]:::ours
API["our API · POST /voice/tools/*<br/>find_procedure · read_page<br/>get_spec · list_parts<br/><i>manualId is in the URL,<br/>not in the model's arguments</i>"]:::ours
PDF[("the manufacturer's PDF<br/>+ per-page text layer<br/>+ spec index with quotes")]:::book
UI["the reader<br/>printed page + orange highlights"]:::ours

SET -.->|"settings, forwarded unread"| MIC
MIC -->|"PCM up"| WK
WK -->|"Authorization: Token<br/>added at the edge"| L
L -->|"transcript · StartOfTurn"| T
T ==>|"function call<br/><b>server to server</b>"| API
API --> PDF
PDF -->|"the manual's own words<br/>+ the page they are printed on"| API
API ==>|"function result"| T
T -->|"one or two sentences,<br/>spoken numbers only"| S
S -->|"PCM down"| WK
WK -->|"80 ms jitter buffer"| MIC
T -.->|"ConversationText<br/><i>'page 115 says…'</i>"| UI
T -.->|"show_page (client_side)"| UI

